# Input

```css
@media(40rem<width),(40rem<width<80rem),(width>=40rem),(color),(aspect-ratio:16/9){.native{color:red}}
@media(40rem<width<calc(80rem - 1rem)){.calculation{display:block}}

```


# Formatted

```css
@media (40rem < width), (40rem < width < 80rem), (width >= 40rem), (color),
	(aspect-ratio: 16 / 9) {
	.native {
		color: red;
	}
}
@media (40rem < width < calc(80rem - 1rem)) {
	.calculation {
		display: block;
	}
}

```
